# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-includes.
#
# The repository root .gitignore carries `pri*` and `ig*` (shorthand for
# "private"/"ignore" scratch files) and `package-lock.json`. Those patterns are
# fine for the rest of this monorepo but silently swallow core files here:
#   pri*                -> prisma/  (schema, every migration, the seed)
#                       -> src/domain/pricing.ts, src/domain/priority.ts
#   package-lock.json   -> the lockfile this app needs for reproducible installs
#
# Without these negations a clean clone has no database schema and does not
# build, and nothing warns you. Keep them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!pri*
!prisma/
!package-lock.json

node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.storage/
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/

screenshots/
walkthrough.html
dist-scripts/

# UI audit output — screenshots and findings are regenerated, never reviewed in a diff.
ui-audit/
